# Template for ~/.config/scan-secrets/internal-terms  (copy it there, fill it in, chmod 600).
# NEVER commit the real file: it would publish exactly what it exists to hide.
#
# Internal system vocabulary that must not appear in anything public: agent and
# profile names, tool and script names, the names of private folders. One
# extended-regex fragment per line; blank lines and '#' comments are ignored.
# Matched case-sensitively, on word boundaries (these are identifiers, not prose).
#
# Placeholders only:
my-agent-name
internal-tool-[a-z-]+\.py
private-vault-folder
